# Docker build context excludes. The *-api Dockerfiles build from the repo root so the
# turbo pruner can read the full workspace graph — keep the context small and secret-free.

# Dependencies & build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-scripts
**/.turbo
out
.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets & local env — NEVER copy into an image (config is injected at runtime)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS & tooling metadata
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Project meta / docs / agent tooling — not needed to build or run
.mdd
.claude
.mddrc*
**/*.md
!**/README.md

# Test & coverage artifacts
**/coverage
**/.vitest
**/*.log

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
